  "notes": "Mac mover trial C, 2026-09-24, mechanics-only (protocol mover-early-entry-v1-20260924 paper_e2e; candidate 10:00|G0.20|V250000|any|X1, nothing validated). Trial B's design, run on the engine at PR #205 head d7a11b3 (partial-fill precision fix) to observe it on the broker. Deviations: the 10:00 rule is scanned at trial start (about 14:52 ET, so the prefilter uses the latest trade then) and entries are at trial start instead of 10:00, so that the candidate's X1 (15:58 marketable limit) falls inside the engine's hold bound. trial_end_et 16:10 lets the window's hard flatten (start + 68 min) bind. All caps are config-mover.json's."
